<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR rates down across all maturities.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR rates down across all maturities.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) nudged down across all maturities, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The PHIBOR market reflected the softening in money market rates following the maturities of special series Treasury bills, traders said.  </p>
<p>Average rates quoted by 20 banks were:</p>
<p>			  OCT 10		 OCT 9</p>
<p>    1 W		12			12 3/16</p>
<p>    2 W		11 13/16		12</p>
<p>    1 M		11 11/16		11 3/4</p>
<p>    2 M		11  5/8		 11 11/16</p>
<p>    3 M		11  5/8		 11 11/16</p>
<p>    6 M		11  3/4		 11 3/4</p>
<p>    12M		11 13/16		11 7/8</p>
<p>    VAL		11-Oct		  10-Oct</p>
<p>- LILIAN KARUNUNGAN (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
